Subject: [PATCH 1544/3799] soh: rename D_8089B9C0 -> sWallSpeeds

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the current sliding speed of each of the four wall segments, shared between all four actors so the ladder check can see whether a neighbouring segment is moving.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Zurerukabe/z_bg_jya_zurerukabe.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
